#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover 2"
msgstr "Trasporto 2"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve several titanium cubes."
msgstr "Recupera più cubi di titanio."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover"
msgstr "Mover"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This exercise is very similar to the previous one. There are now three <a "
"object|titan>titanium cubes</a> that you must move to 3 finishing pads. Here"
" are the coordinates of the finishing pads:"
msgstr ""
"Questo esercizio è simile al precedente, ma ora devi spostare tre <a "
"object|titan>cubi di titanio</a> su tre piattaforme di arrivo. Ecco le "
"coordinate delle piattaforme:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\tx=10, y=-60\n"
"\tx=10, y=-65\n"
"\tx=10, y=-70"
msgstr ""
"\tx=10, y=-60\n"
"\tx=10, y=-65\n"
"\tx=10, y=-70"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Look for the most distant titanium cube with <code><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a></code>."
msgstr "Cerca il cubo più lontano con <code><a cbot|radar>radar</a></code>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pick it up with <code><a cbot|grab>grab</a></code>."
msgstr "Prendilo con <code><a cbot|grab>grab</a></code>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to one of the pads with <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>."
msgstr "Raggiungi una piattaforma con <code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drop the titanium with <code><a cbot|drop>drop</a></code>."
msgstr "Posa il titanio con <code><a cbot|drop>drop</a></code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you look for the nearest titanium cube, the radar would find one that you"
" already retrieved and dropped on a pad. Therefore you must look for the "
"most distant titanium cube."
msgstr ""
"Cercando il cubo più vicino ritroveresti quello già posato su una "
"piattaforma: cerca quindi il più lontano."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "The program"
msgstr "Il programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use a <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> loop in order to repeat 3 times all "
"the instructions necessary to retrieve the titanium cube. Inside the loop, "
"in order to find the most distant titanium cube, use the instruction <c/><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(Titanium, 0, 360, 0, 1000, -1);<n/>. The last value "
"<code>-1</code> means that instead of looking for the closest item, the "
"radar will return the most distant that it can find."
msgstr ""
"Usa un ciclo <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> per ripetere tre volte il "
"recupero. Cerca il cubo più lontano con <c/><a "
"cbot|radar>radar</a>(Titanium, 0, 360, 0, 1000, -1);<n/>: l’ultimo parametro"
" <code>-1</code> seleziona il più lontano invece del più vicino."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"object  metal;\n"
"metal = radar(Titanium, 0, 360, 0, 1000, -1);\n"
"if ( metal == null )  return;\n"
"goto(metal.position);"
msgstr ""
"object  metal;\n"
"metal = radar(Titanium, 0, 360, 0, 1000, -1);\n"
"if ( metal == null )  return;\n"
"goto(metal.position);"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The variable <code>metal</code> if of type <code><a "
"cbot|object>object</a></code>. In order to know the position of the object "
"described by the variable, you must write <code>metal.position</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code>metal</code> è di tipo <code><a cbot|object>object</a></code>. La "
"posizione è <code>metal.position</code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <code>x</code> coordinates of the 3 pads are all equal to 10. The "
"<code>y</code> coordinates are respectively -60, -65 and -70. The most "
"efficient way to get the coordinates of the pads is to use the value of "
"<code>i</code> of the <code>for</code> loop that will take successively the "
"values 0, 1 and 2:"
msgstr ""
"Le tre coordinate <code>x</code> valgono 10; le <code>y</code> sono -60, -65"
" e -70. Ricavale usando <code>i</code> del ciclo <code>for</code>, che "
"assume 0, 1 e 2:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dest.x = 10;\n"
"dest.y = -60-5*i;"
msgstr ""
"dest.x = 10;\n"
"dest.y = -60-5*i;"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is up to you now to finish the program."
msgstr "Ora completa il programma."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repeat 3 times:"
msgstr "Ripeti 3 volte:"
